          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezikiya wakalala tulu ne bankambua bandi, bakamujika ku mukuna mu nkita ya bana ba Davidi; Bena Yuda bonso ne ba mu Yelushalema bakamutumbisha mu lufu luandi. Manashe muanʼandi wakakokesha mu muaba wandi.",
          "type": "text",
